WEBVTT

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.460
We sigh whenever we're about to come to a standstill

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.460
Owarinaki tabi no tochuu tachidomarisouna toki

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:30.710
While moving on this endless journey.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:30.710
Fukai tameiki kobosu bokura wa

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.430
Everytime we lunge for it, it escapes and flies off.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.430
Tsukamikaketewa mata hanareteitta

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.850
But now, there's nothing to be afraid of

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.850
Demo ima wa mou nanimo osoreru koto wa nai

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:53.780
The powerful ties that bind our hearts

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:53.780
Kokoro wo tsunagu tsuyoi kizuna wa

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.240
Will never come loose.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:59.240
Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.960
After a lifetime of searching, we finally arrived

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:08.960
Sagashitsuzukete tadoritsuita

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.760
Here, where the period lies.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:14.760
Kono basho de piriodo ni

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:24.060
Let's change all our sorrow and rage to power.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:24.060
Kanashimi ikari chikara ni kaete

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.980
Destiny is right within our reach.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.980
Unmei wa sugu soba ni

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Revving at Full Throttle

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Revving at Full Throttle

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.430
It's been a while, Al.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.740
Yeah.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:43.420
So... I heard from Pinako.

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.750
About what happened to your body and such.

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:56.440
There he is!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.600
Mr. Hoh, do you think you could lend us a hand?

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.990
Oh, sure.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:03.910
Let's catch up on things later.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:04.890
S-Sure.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:17.400
That radio you guys fixed for me back then has been working great.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:20.210
There's no static coming from it anymore.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.750
I'm sorry. All of this happened because we messed with Cornello.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.430
Hey, don't worry about it.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.900
The city came to its senses because you two exposed his crime.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:37.960
I guess there was a riot, but look at it now.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.630
Aren't those beautiful sounds?

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:47.470
They're rebuilding the city.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:50.130
Leaving no resentment behind.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.060
I'll go help out too.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.960
Please look after Winry for me, Rose.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.260
I guess we'll see what we can help out with.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:03.430
Let's go, Yoki.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:04.410
Huh?

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:05.830
What about food?

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.460
It'll taste better if you eat after  you work!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.800
Let's go!

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.180
Hey! Let go of me!

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.710
I want to eat!

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.810
Huh? That was your son?

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.250
Oh, that must have been awfully rude of us.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:23.180
It must have been a while since you've seen him.
Can you really just leave him hanging?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:27.180
Well, I left the house many years ago.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.180
I don't think he trusts me as a father.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.750
Not really sure what to talk about with him...

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.560
Dad!

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:38.920
Umm...

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.190
I'll help too!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.770
Let me take that for you.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.660
Here.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.510
How's the bath, Winry?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.550
It's the best!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:07.550
I don't even remember the last time I soaked in the tub...

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.600
I'll leave your change of clothes right here.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.310
Thank you so much!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.650
Rose's so sweet!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.120
I find you really admirable, by the way.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.890
You're so young, but you've already set yourself up in the automail business.

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:25.950
Did you make Ed's leg too?

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.410
Yeah.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.950
We're old friends, so it was the least I could do.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.720
That's amazing!

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:34.930
So you're the one who gave Ed a leg so he could stand up.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.610
Then in turn, he gave me the strength to stand up.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.270
So in a way, you saved me as well.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:47.430
I was told my late boyfriend could be revived.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:52.970
Hearing that and believing in their miracles, I gave myself up to Leto.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:59.440
That was just around the time when Ed and Al came here and exposed the priest's lies.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:05.080
What I've been clinging on to just disappeared like that, so I was feeling pretty hopeless.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.710
And that was when Ed scolded me.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:14.080
He told me to get up and keep on going.

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:18.520
I'm so sorry! He's always like that!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.340
Why can't he be nicer about things?

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.380
It was  nice.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.310
That was Ed's kindness.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.720
You're aware of that too, aren't you?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.360
Thanks to him, we came to our senses.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.310
Everyone in this city, including myself.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:45.650
We're all trying to get back on our feet without relying on miracles.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.170
It's all thanks to Ed and Al.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:52.880
Ed...

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:02.060
I followed those soldiers, but I ended up in some crazy place.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.460
Mr. Greed...

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:34.280
What is and is not ethical changes with time and also depends on whom you ask.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.570
That is not the reason.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.750
It is to prevent an individual from creating a powerful army of their own, Major General.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.250
They're not actually human...

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.710
They're dolls, I take it?

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:48.380
Precisely.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:54.140
We will create soldiers by inserting souls into these humanoids.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:58.080
They will be the ultimate soldiers that obey our every command.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.000
In other words, an immortal army.

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.150
Do you mind if I ask something?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.730
What is it?

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:11.240
Where would you obtain the souls to attach to them?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:17.740
From the people of the countries we've crushed, and have yet to crush.

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:23.100
The battlefield will become a hunting ground where we can obtain thousands of souls.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:28.870
Central is scary!!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.260
It's unbelievably cruel!

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:33.260
There's no way Mr. Greed would be here!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.980
An underground tunnel?

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.220
Yeah.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.980
I wanted to check whether there's one under this city.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.130
If there is...!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.890
No, there has to be! Then-

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:49.890
Hold that thought.

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.650
Let's take this somewhere private.

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:59.160
So you came to Lior to prevent the activation of the Nationwide Transmutation Circle?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.070
Yeah.

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.710
Then I found you  here! What a surprise!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.170
It makes me feel lucky.

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:09.500
We met a man who looks just like you underneath Central.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.550
I seriously doubt that there's no link between you two.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.450
I figured you knew who he was.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.010
Are you sure this is a good idea, Alphonse?

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:23.060
What if I was on their side?

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:29.260
Didn't you consider the possibility that everything you just said could make it to the enemy's ears?

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.170
I'm really happy that you trust me.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.450
Thanks.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:45.550
Of course!

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:50.960
So he's trusting a failure like me as a real father...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.740
Now...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:57.860
I guess it's my  turn to trust my sons and to tell them everything I know.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.470
It's a long story.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.970
I want Edward to hear it as well.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.440
The thing is, Brother...

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.710
...has gone missing.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:23.330
Can I help the next customer, please?

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:32.290
I'd like to make a withdrawal from State Alchemist Edward Elric's research account.

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:34.370
Would that be you?

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:35.990
No, I'm here on his behalf.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.300
I have a power of attorney and also his signature.

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:41.930
Thank you, sir.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.520
This is the northern branch of Banks Bank.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:53.440
A withdrawal has just been made from
State Alchemist Mr. Edward Elric's account.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.250
The man claimed to be here on his behalf.

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.450
Yes. He was a very large man...

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:01.750
Here's your money.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.200
Okay. This should do.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.580
Jesus, what a rip-off.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.670
What are you talking about?

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.210
With the hush money included, this is just the right amount.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:21.120
Well, we appreciate your not probing into our matters.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:21.760
Darius!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.810
They caught up to us.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.130
Coming.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.690
Oh my, a soldier.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.620
Is someone injured?

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:37.230
We're looking for someone.

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.740
Is he your only patient?

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:41.610
Anyone staying in the back?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.330
Just one in the back-

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.110
Are you the only one staying here?

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:55.450
Yes... can I help you?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:58.450
You're the one who went to the bank, aren't you?

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:01.220
Don't move!

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:06.520
Halt!

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.810
Are you from this clinic?

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.400
Both hands in the air, slowly!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:15.440
Have you seen anyone going in and out of this clinic recently?

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:19.440
His characteristics are...

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.400
What's wrong?!

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:22.280
Both hands in the air!

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.770
Red coat, blonde hair in a braid...

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:27.280
...and very short.

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.290
What was that?!

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.210
Harris!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:34.800
Get yourself together!

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.290
Who did this to you?!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.090
Hey Harri-

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.330
Cohen! Harris!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.470
What happened?! Say something!

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.950
Didn't bother to save any for us.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.550
Don't push yourself.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.750
You haven't fully recovered yet, have you?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.080
Don't treat me like a patient!

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:19.280
I'm at full throttle and ready to go!

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.800
Thanks for everything, Doc.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:31.520
No need to thank me. Just go already!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.350
Try not to trouble us any further.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:41.190
So they're looking for a blonde guy in a red coat who has his hair in a braid...

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:44.320
Maybe I'll stay like this for a while.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.360
Freeze!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.410
Put down your weapons!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.240
There's more of them?!

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.290
Hands above your head! Now!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:52.950
You!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.580
Get away from those two! They're dangerous!

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.340
You're  the one that's going to freeze!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.710
You want to see this kid's head get blown off?!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.640
We're going to secure a vehicle.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:17.350
Right.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.860
They're after us, Donkey Kong!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.200
Don't call me that!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.950
They're catching up!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.370
They're from the northern army!

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.990
I can't outrun them in the snow.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:39.370
That was close.

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.630
How's it looking like in the back?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.130
Bad! They're catching up!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.210
Dammit...!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:45.960
Take that right!

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:46.970
Get on that street!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.590
What?!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.840
Don't ask questions!

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.760
Shit!!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.350
I don't get you at all!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.350
As soon as you get past the corner, make a u-turn!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.430
Don't let them get away!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.360
Huh?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.950
W-Where did they go?

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.570
I think they made that turn!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.080
That worked out well.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.460
Hey... transmute it back to something simple.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.550
Why?!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:26.710
This looks badass!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:28.010
Just do it!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.550
Please, just do it!

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.800
What the hell?!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.260
Do you have a problem with my design?!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:34.680
Too many to list!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.440
We have nowhere to go again.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.650
Yeah.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:50.070
I wasted so much time because I let my guard down against Kimblee.

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:55.780
I wonder if Al was able to meet up with Winry and them...

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.040
Hey, Fullmetal! You listening?

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.960
What do we do now?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.210
Well...

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:06.340
I'd just like some information right now,
whatever that may be.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.300
We need to meet up with Al and the others.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.550
So where are they?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.340
Where do we go to meet up with them?

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:17.810
Where would Al go...

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.930
Think... Think...!{no, not a jimmy neutron reference ~koki}

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.190
You listening?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.200
Well... so...

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.330
You were a slave, and now you're a philosopher's stone?

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.910
Yup, exactly.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.420
Guess it's pretty unbelievable after all...

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.210
Well, I don't blame you.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:51.420
You'd have to be crazy to believe a story like that out of the blue.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:58.060
Well... I guess I'm crazy then.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:01.480
You accept things pretty quickly.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:03.520
To tell you the truth, I'm pretty nervous.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.820
But... I guess it's easier to believe because my body is also like this.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:17.030
Hey... how does it feel to be immortal?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:18.910
"How does it feel"...?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.290
I guess it's convenient in many ways.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:27.500
But it's sad that I have to see my loved ones go before me.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.170
Mom?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:40.600
Hey Dad, you're a philosopher's stone,
which means your body isn't exactly normal, right?

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:43.560
Then are Brother and I...

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.440
Are you asking whether you two are normal humans?

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.440
Yeah.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.690
Don't worry.

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:54.530
My soul is fused with the philosopher's stone,

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.870
but the actual core that holds me together is myself, a human being.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.450
But the one at Central...

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:07.500
He's only wearing a shell that resembles me.

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.380
A shell?

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.670
Yeah.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:15.170
So if you break the shell, you should be able to defeat him.

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:16.840
"Defeat"...?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.890
Oh, right.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:25.480
Aren't they trying to recreate the tragedy at Xerxes by using this country?

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.980
If we don't stop them soon, there'll be a disaster.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.440
Whoa... not bad.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.360
You've figured out this much.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.490
And this one must be the reverse transmutation circle.

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.320
The quick way would be to destroy the underground tunnel.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.780
That's why-

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.120
Don't even think about it.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:48.500
A powerful homunculus by the name of Pride lurks in the tunnel.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:52.000
But if we don't hurry, their transmutation circle will be...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:55.710
It may already be complete, or has been for a while.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.510
Then all the more reason to...!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.510
"The Day" hasn't come yet.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.800
"The Day"?

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.310
Alphonse.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.270
Don't be focused on what's at your feet. Look above you.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.810
If you do, you'll be able to see new things.

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.400
Above...

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.480
The sky?

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.400
Sun God Leto?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.320
He's waiting for "The Day".

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.250
What the hell?!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.870
What did I  do?!

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.430
Good!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.600
Lively people like you make me smile.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.680
You have no idea how boring it is to guard this place.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:50.560
It's a real pleasure having someone like you visit.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.150
The Ultimate Shield...!

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:58.110
Along with that tone and the way you laugh...!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.530
Damn you for mimicking Mr. Greed!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.200
That's right, I'm Greed.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.240
Surprised you knew that.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.120
The greedy...?

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.540
Yup.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.620
This entire world belongs to me.

00:19:12.120 --> 00:19:15.590
I want money, women, status, fame...

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.630
"And everything else in this world!"

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.300
No way...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.340
But it has to be...

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:23.340
Who are you?

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.640
Mr. Greed!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.140
Is it really you?!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.140
What happened to you?!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.640
I'm asking who you are!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.270
It's me!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.150
Bido from Dublith!

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.480
You forgot your friend?!

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:40.320
Dublith!

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:43.320
Ah, it all makes sense now.

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.450
Do you remember now?!

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:47.410
Sorry.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.330
You're probably talking about the previous Greed.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.330
Why...

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.370
I don't know you.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.290
Mr. G...reed...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.460
We're... friends...

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:04.800
Getting rid of intruders is my job.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.220
Sorry man.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:10.810
What's this?

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.490
You've got to be kidding me...

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.490
You've gotten pretty low, Greed.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:34.500
Why the hell did you kill your own friend?!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.380
He wasn't... my friend...!

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.470
Then what about these memories?!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:46.890
Are you trying to say that Bido guy was spitting out lies?!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:50.560
They're memories of the previous Greed, not mine!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.810
Then why are you wracked with pain?!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.190
Get your shit together, man!

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:01.940
If you start to lose it, my soul will steal back my body!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:07.160
The previous Greed's soul had its memories wiped and purified.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.030
I've forgotten all of my past!

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.250
My ass you did!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.120
Friends are connected by heart!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:22.090
You can't just rinse off something that's stained on your soul!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.460
Look!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.760
Your very being is crying out!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:32.350
You've cut down a family member that was connected to you by soul!

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.140
Greed!

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.730
You're supposed to be greedy enough to want to keep everything !

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.730
You disgust me!!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:04.300
The promise we never made

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:04.300
Kawashita hazu no nai yakasoku ga

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.090
yet again

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:05.090
Kyou mo

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.930
tries to snatch our future away from us.

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.930
Bokura no mirai wo ubaou to suru

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:15.520
Why is it that we can't rejoice

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:15.520
Hoshigatteita mono wo te ni shitemo

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.520
straight from the heart

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.520
Sunao ni

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:21.480
when we obtain something we've always been after?

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:21.480
Umaku waraenai nowa nazedarou

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:27.190
The overflowing tears aren't from feebleness or remorse.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:27.190
Afureru namida wo yowasa ya koukai ja nai

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.990
They're fragments born from agony.

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.990
Itami ga unda kakera de

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:37.040
Of all the moments and destinies,

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:37.040
Donna shunkan datte unmei datte

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:45.800
I realized there's one absolute certainty.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:45.800
Hitotsu dake tashika na mono ga aru to shitta

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:48.340
Even if things get tough and I'm at my limit

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:48.340
Genkai datte konnan datte

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:52.340
I refuse to give up.

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:52.340
Akirametakunaiyo

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:57.220
Please, don't let go.

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:57.220
Konomama hanasanaide

00:22:57.220 --> 00:23:05.070
I can feel the warmth of your right hand

00:22:57.220 --> 00:23:05.070
Kataku nigirishimeta kimi no migite no nukumori

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:08.740
where it's tightly joined with my left.

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:08.740
Koko ni arukara

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:21.870
What about this book?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.710
I read it when I was about your age.

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:29.210
It's a tale about an adventurer who travels around the world.

00:23:31.470 --> 00:23:32.340
What was that?!

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:43.480
Who is it?

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:01.960
The battle has begun.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.710
No one can hold back his anger anymore.

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:08.210
Which one of them will survive?

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:12.880
And what is the truth that is
gradually revealed after the duel?

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:18.260
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:22.290
Episode 45, The Promised Day.

00:24:18.280 --> 00:24:22.290
The Promised Day

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:26.810
Those who share the same ambition, gather.
